		{ TEXT("\"Bayu? Wah, lama sekali itu. Dulu, sebelum jadi tempatmu, di sini ada rental PS kecil punya Pak Darto. Bayu itu bocah langganan, tiap malam main sampai jam dua belas. Waktu rentalnya tutup tahun '99, dia nangis karena game naganya belum tamat. Katanya sekarang sudah kerja di kota.\""), TEXT("\"Bayu? Oh, that was a long time ago. Before this was your place, Pak Darto ran a small PS rental here. Bayu was a regular kid who played every night until midnight. When the rental closed in '99 he cried because he never finished his dragon game. I hear he works in the city now.\"") },
		{ TEXT("\"Mas, sudah jam sepuluh lewat. Warga komplain suara teriakan main game sampai ke gang sebelah.\""), TEXT("\"It's past ten. The neighbors are complaining about gaming yells reaching the next alley.\"") },
