		{ TEXT("Bayu dan server tua"), TEXT("Bayu and the old server") },
		{ TEXT("Bayu datang bersama teman-teman lamanya, sekarang sudah bapak-bapak semua. Mereka main \"Legenda Naga Online\" sampai larut, teriak dan tertawa seperti anak SMP lagi. Sebelum pulang Bayu menyerahkan flashdisk: \"Servernya buat Abang. Pasang terus ya, biar anak-anak sekarang kenal game ini.\""), TEXT("Bayu arrives with his old friends, all dads now. They play \"Dragon Legend Online\" late into the night, yelling and laughing like middle schoolers again. Before leaving, Bayu hands you a flash drive: \"The server is yours. Keep it running so today's kids get to know this game.\"") },
		{ TEXT("Bayu masuk sambil tertawa. \"Bang, itu saya yang ngetik dari laptop! Ternyata game naga itu dulu punya mode online, servernya mati tahun 2004. Saya hidupkan lagi servernya di rumah. Boleh dites di sini malam Minggu? Teman-teman lama mau ikut.\""), TEXT("Bayu walks in laughing. \"That was me typing from my laptop! Turns out the dragon game had an online mode, but the servers died in 2004. I brought one back to life at home. Can we test it here Saturday night? My old friends want to join.\"") },
		{ TEXT("Bayu sumringah: \"Abang memang juragan sejati!\""), TEXT("Bayu beams: \"You're a true juragan!\"") },
		{ TEXT("Besok akhir pekan: kamu bisa mengadakan turnamen PS."), TEXT("Tomorrow is the weekend: you can hold a PS tournament.") },
